Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Data Definition Without A Name And Assert Error Message
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName||
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLDataDefinition click Save
	Then Alert view Required Field
Scenario: Add List Without Data Definition And Assert Error Message
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And Click at locator 'Button#PLUS'
	And Type click At Type the value 'List Name' at locator 'TextInput#NAME'
	And Button click Save
	And Alert view Request Failed To Complete
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Please enter a valid definition.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
Scenario: Add List With XSS Workflow Definition
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Definition|
	And Workflow upload Definition
		|workflowDefinitionFile|workflow_definition_xss.xml|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|New Uploaded Definition|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|To Do|
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	Then DDLList view CP
Scenario: Add Record
Priority: 4
