	And DDLList add CP
		|ddlListDescription|DDL List Description|
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|DDL Definition|
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|DDL Definition|
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Record Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text Label|
		|fieldName|TextName|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Page add
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Dynamic Data Lists Display|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLList select Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Display Page|
	And DDLRecord add Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|DDL Definition|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Record Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text Label|
		|fieldName|TextName|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLNavigator goto List Records
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	Then DDLRecord view First Field CP
