	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord edit CP
		|ddlListName|Dynamic Data List|
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Content, Content 2|
	And DDLRecord add Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Catalan (Spain)|
	And DDLRecord populate Translation Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Contenido|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord edit CP
		|ddlListName|Dynamic Data List|
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Content, Content 2|
