Scenario: Add Repeatable Field As Non Admin User
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|DDMRegRole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACTION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Action|
		|permissionNavigationKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS|
		|permissionNavigationValue|Dynamic Data Lists|
		|roleTitle|DDMRegRole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS_RECORD_SET_ADD_RECORD_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Record|
		|permissionNavigationKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS|
		|permissionNavigationValue|Dynamic Data Lists|
		|roleTitle|DDMRegRole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS_RECORD_SET_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|View|
		|permissionNavigationKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_DYNAMIC_DATA_LISTS|
		|permissionNavigationValue|Dynamic Data Lists|
		|roleTitle|DDMRegRole Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea1@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn1|
		|userLastName|userln1|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea1@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role assign Reg Role CP
		|roleTitle|DDMRegRole Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DynamicDataMapping edit Field Repeatable
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
	And DDLDataDefinition save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
	And DDLList save
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea1@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn1 userln1|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord add CP
	And DDLRecord add Repeatable Field
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Text
		|ddlRecordFieldData|Content|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And DDLRecord view Text Field Repeated
		|ddlRecordFieldData1|Content|
		|ddlRecordFieldData2|Content 2|
	Then PortletEntry publish
Scenario: Add Select Field With Translation And View In Spreadsheet View
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
