	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLDataDefinition add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Select|
		|fieldFieldLabel|SelectENG|
		|fieldName|Select|
	And DynamicDataMapping edit Field Options
		|field|Select|
		|fieldFieldLabel|SelectENG|
		|fieldName|Select|
		|fieldOptionsNames|ENGOption1|
		|fieldOptionsValue|value 1|
	And DDLRecord edit Translation
		|localizedLanguage|Japanese (Japan)|
	And DynamicDataMapping edit Field
		|field|Select|
		|fieldFieldLabel|SelectENG|
		|fieldFieldLabelEdit|SelectJA|
	And DynamicDataMapping edit Field Options
		|field|Select|
		|fieldFieldLabel|SelectJA|
		|fieldName|Select|
		|fieldOptionsNames|JAOption1|
	And DDLDataDefinition save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLList add CP
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLDataDefinition select CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
	And DDLList save
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Dynamic Data Lists|
	And DDLRecord add CP
		|ddlDataDefinitionName|Data Definition|
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And DDLRecord populate Field Select
		|ddlRecordFieldData|ENGOption1|
		|fieldFieldLabel|SelectENG|
		|fieldName|Select|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Dynamic Data Lists Display|
	And DDLList select Via DDL Display PG
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Page|
	And DDLDisplayPortlet configure List View PG
		|configureCheckBoxName|TEMPLATES_SPREADSHEET_VIEW_CHECKBOX|
		|configureChecked|true|
		|ddlListName|DDL List|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Page|
	And DDLDisplayPortlet view Field Select Via Spreadsheet View
		|ddlRecordFieldData|ENGOption1|
		|ddlRecordRow|1|
		|fieldName|Select|
	And Navigator open Specific URL
		|url|${portalURL}/ja/|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dynamic Data Lists Page|
	Then DDLDisplayPortlet view Field Select Via Spreadsheet View
